# Astrans Global DMS — portable v1 architecture

## Hosting (current)

- Build and test on **Vercel + Supabase** (same pattern as Astrans Tasks).
- Do **not** block feature work on Oracle capacity or home PC Coolify.
- Do **not** introduce paid Oracle Cloud resources (see `oracle-always-free-only.mdc`).

## Data & jobs

- **Postgres-first** for all core DMS state; migrations under `supabase/migrations/`.
- **No Redis** and no always-on workers in v1.
- Background work must be **cron-friendly / batched** (short Vercel functions).
- Do not make Vercel KV/Blob the system of record for inventory/ledger.

## Testing

- Local: `npm run dev` + `.env.local`
- Remote: Vercel Preview + Production
- After v1: use `docs/LIMITS_AND_MIGRATION.md` before choosing home PC / VPS

